      "id": 1,
      "title": "Selected presentation topology",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "> **Derived presentation view.** Grafana is not evidence authority. The importer verifies the sealed bundle first. Provenance is limited to the selected bundle slug and checksum-manifest hash. Missing evidence stays **MISSING**.\n\n`INTERFACE authenticated HTTP admission` → `DURABLE PostgreSQL authority + outbox` → `RUNTIME relay` → `DURABLE ordered Pub/Sub subscription` → `RUNTIME fixed StreamingPull candidate fleet` → `DURABLE ThreadEvents` → `INTERFACE authenticated cursor SSE`\n\nStreamingPull is the selected candidate pending production qualification. The selected run table below states whether its evidence is qualifying or contextual.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Retained and rejected decisions",
